{"id": 14866, "jp_tail": "それから数日後。", "zh": "那之后过了几天。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14867, "jp_tail": "と顔を合わせた。", "zh": "中庭。我又一次和『那个人』打了照面。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14868, "jp_tail": "、“また”だね」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「哟，“又”见面了呢」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14869, "jp_tail": "クラ】「ですね」", "zh": "【Sakura】「是呢」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14870, "jp_tail": "私も笑みを返す。", "zh": "我一回答，Yuichi同学便绽开了笑容。我也回以微笑。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14871, "jp_tail": "けてましたから」", "zh": "【Sakura】「Ayano同学，我想现在是在病房里。因为直到刚才，她都在做下午的检查」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14872, "jp_tail": "か、ありがとう」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「哦。这样啊，谢啦」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14873, "jp_tail": "りと時計を見た。", "zh": "这么说着，他瞥了一眼手表。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14874, "jp_tail": "いでいるのかな。", "zh": "是在赶时间吗。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14875, "jp_tail": "のことだけは――", "zh": "可是，唯独这件事――", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14876, "jp_tail": "ラ】「あの……」", "zh": "【Sakura】「那个……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14877, "jp_tail": "ウイチ】「ん？」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「嗯？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14878, "jp_tail": "てるんですか？」", "zh": "【Sakura】「和Ayano同学，是在交往吗？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14879, "jp_tail": "チ】「え……？」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「诶……？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14880, "jp_tail": "の動きが止まる。", "zh": "Yuichi同学的动作停住了。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14881, "jp_tail": "て、そんな……」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「为什么，问这种……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14882, "jp_tail": "感じがしたので」", "zh": "【Sakura】「因为有那种感觉」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14883, "jp_tail": "逸らして答えた。", "zh": "Yuichi同学把视线从我身上移开，回答道。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14884, "jp_tail": "したくないんだ」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「不……哪有的事。我不想破坏现在的关系」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14885, "jp_tail": "うなんですか？」", "zh": "【Sakura】「……是这样吗？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14886, "jp_tail": "そうなんですよ」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「正是这样的呢」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14887, "jp_tail": "サクラ】「……」", "zh": "【Sakura】「……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14888, "jp_tail": "化しちゃったね」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「……。抱歉，刚才逗你玩了呢」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14889, "jp_tail": "サクラ】「……」", "zh": "【Sakura】「……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14890, "jp_tail": "このままでいい」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「呃。唔——。嘛，有各种各样的原因啦。现在呢，就这样就好」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14891, "jp_tail": "…ユウイチさん」", "zh": "【Sakura】「……Yuichi同学」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14892, "jp_tail": "名前をつぶやく。", "zh": "我轻声念出了他的名字。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14893, "jp_tail": "はいるのかい？」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「诶？ 嗯、嘛，嗯……是啊。那么，你有喜欢的人吗？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14894, "jp_tail": "…え、ええっと」", "zh": "【Sakura】「……诶，那、那个」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14895, "jp_tail": "がら私に訊ねる。", "zh": "他一边往纸袋里探头看着，一边问我。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14896, "jp_tail": "って感じかな？」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「哦，就这反应，是心里有人了吧？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14897, "jp_tail": "んなことは……」", "zh": "【Sakura】「没、没有那种事……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14898, "jp_tail": "がら聞いてくる。", "zh": "Yuichi同学一边说着「给你」把甜甜圈递过来，一边问我。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14899, "jp_tail": "しないのかい？」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「不去告白吗？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14900, "jp_tail": "でいいから……」", "zh": "【Sakura】「那个……。因为现在这样的关系，就好……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14901, "jp_tail": "応援してるよ！」", "zh": "【Yuichi】「这样啊……。是有这种情况呢。嘛，我想是挺不容易的，不过我给你加油哦！」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14902, "jp_tail": "りと目にして――", "zh": "这么说完，Yuichi同学瞟了一眼戴在手腕上的表――", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14903, "jp_tail": "去ってしまった。", "zh": "说了句「抱歉呀，到时间了」，转眼之间就跑走了。", "score": 80, "note": "引号内按中文断句补逗号（§7(b) 标点不照搬）：「抱歉呀到时间了」→「抱歉呀，到时间了」。", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14904, "jp_tail": "ラ】「……ふう」", "zh": "【Sakura】「……呼」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14905, "jp_tail": "ため息をついた。", "zh": "我叹了一小口气。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14539, "jp_tail": "さに見舞われた。", "zh": "就在那时，一阵剧烈的呼吸困难向我袭来。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14540, "jp_tail": "ことができない。", "zh": "耳鸣，喉咙深处烧灼般地发烫，就算吸气，也只是发出像风声一样难听的声音，没法好好呼吸。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14541, "jp_tail": "り、目を瞑った。", "zh": "我把已经伸向呼叫铃的手缩回被子里，连头一起蒙住，闭上了眼睛。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14542, "jp_tail": "うに響いている。", "zh": "一片死寂的声音在耳朵里像回响一样反射着。在那当中，只有我的呼吸声，像是被世界遗落下来一样回荡着。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14543, "jp_tail": "吸』を意識する。", "zh": "能听见自己呼吸的声音。一直听着吸气吐气的声音，就意识到了原本无意识进行着的『呼吸』。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14544, "jp_tail": "胸が苦しくなる。", "zh": "渐渐地，该在哪里吸气、该在什么时机吐气，我都失去了把握。连吸了两次气，胸口难受起来。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14545, "jp_tail": "だっただろうか？", "zh": "现在，是该吸气的时候吗？", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14546, "jp_tail": "だっただろうか？", "zh": "还是说，是该吐气的时候？", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14547, "jp_tail": "無意識的な動き。", "zh": "呼吸，也就是吸气吐气这件事。身体无意识的动作。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14548, "jp_tail": "無意識の呼吸。", "zh": "无意识的呼吸。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14549, "jp_tail": "し、息を止める。", "zh": "我稍微屏住了呼吸。", "score": 85, "note": "§7(b) 副词与谓语间逗号删（#15096 判例）；与 14845 孪生行（jp 逐字相同）同步同改。", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14550, "jp_tail": "……９０秒……。", "zh": "１０秒、_n２０秒、_n３０秒_n……９０秒_n……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14551, "jp_tail": "、空気を求めた。", "zh": "我终于忍不住，贪求起空气来。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14552, "jp_tail": "はできないのだ。", "zh": "原来如此，意识是没法战胜本能的。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14553, "jp_tail": "、なんだろうか。", "zh": "这就是所谓活着这件事，是吗。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14554, "jp_tail": "、息を止めたら？", "zh": "那么，再多一点。要是再多屏住一会儿呢？", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14555, "jp_tail": "きるのだろうか。", "zh": "我是不是，就能比现在更多地感受到『活着』呢。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14556, "jp_tail": "もう少し。", "zh": "再多一点。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14557, "jp_tail": "け――生を……。", "zh": "再多那么一点――活着……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14558, "jp_tail": "頭――頭が痛い。", "zh": "头――头好痛。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14559, "jp_tail": "熱い。そして――", "zh": "耳鸣。_n喉咙深处烧灼般地发烫。_n然后――", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14906, "jp_tail": "例の発作が出た。", "zh": "那个老毛病，又发作了。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14907, "jp_tail": "されてしまった。", "zh": "医生已经一遍、又一遍、再一遍地叮嘱过我，说『这个』一旦发作，就绝对绝对不可以勉强自己。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14908, "jp_tail": "っていたと思う。", "zh": "医生，我觉得，是有点生气了。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14909, "jp_tail": "情、初めて見た。", "zh": "明明一直以来，都那么温柔的。那样生气的表情，我还是第一次看到。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14910, "jp_tail": "……でも。", "zh": "……可是。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14911, "jp_tail": "のは中庭だから。", "zh": "因为能见到那个人的地方，是中庭。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14912, "jp_tail": "で、だけだから。", "zh": "因为，只有在中庭。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14913, "jp_tail": "さんの声がした。", "zh": "走出病房，从前台前面经过的时候，不知从哪里传来了Ayano同学的声音。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14914, "jp_tail": "んの姿が見えた。", "zh": "循着声音的方向找过去，看见了正在打电话的Ayano同学。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14915, "jp_tail": "んは話している。", "zh": "靠在墙上，握着听筒，笑着――Ayano同学正在说话。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14916, "jp_tail": "「アヤノさ――」", "zh": "【Sakura】「Ayano同――」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14917, "jp_tail": "私は声を止めた。", "zh": "正要挥手招呼她的时候，我把话咽了回去。", "score": 82, "note": "§14 搭配：「把声音咽回去」非现成搭配，改「把话咽了回去」（原文 声を止めた＝她正要招呼出声，把招呼咽回）。", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14918, "jp_tail": "んだ。……そう」", "zh": "【Ayano】「Yuichi……。是啊……我喜欢他。果然，你早就发现了呀。……是啊」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14919, "jp_tail": "ラ】「……っ！」", "zh": "【Sakura】「……！」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14920, "jp_tail": "息をのんだ。", "zh": "我倒吸了一口气。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14921, "jp_tail": "はいけないって」", "zh": "【Ayano】「可是……嗯。得把话说清楚，这一点我明白的。不能就这么半吊子下去」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14922, "jp_tail": "息が苦しくなる。", "zh": "搭在柱子上的手很沉。呼吸变得难受起来。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14923, "jp_tail": "な音が出ている。", "zh": "从我自己的嘴里，发出咻咻的、像风声一样难听的声音。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14924, "jp_tail": "るね。うん……」", "zh": "【Ayano】「嗯……谢谢你。我会……说说看的。嗯……」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14925, "jp_tail": "目が霞んでくる。", "zh": "头好痛，眼前渐渐模糊起来。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14926, "jp_tail": "が痛い、頭が――", "zh": "心跳越来越快。喉咙好痛，头――", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14927, "jp_tail": "、こんな所で――", "zh": "不要。为什么，会在这种地方――", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14928, "jp_tail": "――？ あっ！」", "zh": "【Ayano】「等一下！ 刚才，有声音？ 好像有什么响动――？ 啊！」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14929, "jp_tail": "「サクラさん！」", "zh": "【Ayano】「Sakura同学！」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14930, "jp_tail": "くるのが見える。", "zh": "……看得见Ayano同学正朝我这边跑过来。", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14931, "jp_tail": "聞いたら、私――", "zh": "不要。别过来。现在要是听见Ayano同学的声音，我――", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14932, "jp_tail": "】「大丈夫！？」", "zh": "【Ayano】「不要紧吧！？」", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14933, "jp_tail": "私――", "zh": "我――", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14934, "jp_tail": "あれ……。", "zh": "咦……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14935, "jp_tail": "どこだろう……。", "zh": "这里，是哪里呢……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14936, "jp_tail": "聞いていて……。", "zh": "我，正听着Ayano同学打电话……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14937, "jp_tail": "れちゃって……。", "zh": "然后倒下了……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14938, "jp_tail": "……。", "zh": "……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14939, "jp_tail": "……中庭？", "zh": "……中庭？", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14940, "jp_tail": "にいるんだろう？", "zh": "我，为什么会在这里呢？", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14941, "jp_tail": "……。", "zh": "……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14942, "jp_tail": "……。寒い……。", "zh": "好暗……。好冷……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14943, "jp_tail": "アヤノさん……。", "zh": "Ayano同学……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 14944, "jp_tail": "……。", "zh": "……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 15243, "jp_tail": "中庭……。", "zh": "中庭……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 15244, "jp_tail": "……。", "zh": "……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 15245, "jp_tail": "と残してる……。", "zh": "第一次，和Ayano同学相遇时的「故事」，好好地留下来了……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 15246, "jp_tail": "いてるから……。", "zh": "因为，写在日记里了……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 15247, "jp_tail": "の出来事も……。", "zh": "第一次和Yuichi同学相遇时的事情，也……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 15248, "jp_tail": "ちゃ駄目だ……。", "zh": "对了……不能在这里放弃……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
{"id": 15249, "jp_tail": "書かないと……。", "zh": "『明天的日记』，得写才行……", "score": 90, "note": "", "adjudicate": false}
